# Nothing in this repository needs to be built, so this file is short.
#
# What it exists for: making sure that a stray licence, key or rendered values
# file created while you were experimenting locally cannot be committed by
# accident. Belt and braces -- the real copies live only in Kubernetes Secrets.

# Credentials and certificates. Never commit any of these.
*.pem
*.key
*.crt
license.pem
kubeconfig
kubeconfig.*

# Scratch output. The deploy workflow writes these on the runner:
# rendered-values.yaml is helm/values.yaml with the repository variables
# substituted in, and the others are its validation and diagnostics output.
rendered-values.yaml
rendered-manifests.yaml
rendered.yaml
manifests.yaml
diagnostics.txt
ping.json

# The Helm chart, downloaded at run time by both deploy.yml and lint.yml.
/chart/

# Editor and OS noise.
.DS_Store
*.swp
*~
.idea/
.vscode/
